{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09662","headline":"尹相公京兆府中棠树降甘露诗 · 岑参","name":"尹相公京兆府中棠树降甘露诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相国尹京兆，政成人不欺。\n甘露降府庭，上天表无私。\n非无他人家，岂少羣木枝。\n被兹甘棠树，美掩召伯诗。\n团团甜如[蜜]，皛皛凝若脂。\n千柯玉光碎，万叶珠颗垂。\n崑仑何时来，庆云相逐飞。\n魏宫铜盘贮，汉帝金掌持。\n王泽布人和，精心动灵只。\n君臣日同德，祯瑞方潜施。\n何术令大臣，感通能及兹。\n忽惊政化理，暗与神物期。\n却笑赵张辈，徒称今古稀。\n爲君天下酒，麴糵将用时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}